Input: {"question": "What is the length of the Moravica river?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00", "start": 0, "end": 138, "text": "Golijska Moravica The Golijska Moravica or simply Moravica (Serbian Cyrillic: Голијска Моравица or Моравица) is a river in western Serbia."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00", "start": 139, "end": 276, "text": "With a length of 98 km, it is the longer headstream of the Zapadna Morava (it forms it with the Đetinja), and thus, of the Velika Morava."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00", "start": 277, "end": 427, "text": "Its name, Moravica, means \"little Morava\" in Serbian, and it also gives its name to the surrounding region and the modern Moravica District of Serbia."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00", "start": 428, "end": 603, "text": "The Golijska Moravica originates from the western slopes of the Golija mountain and flows straight to the north, between the Golija and Javor mountains, through the Stari Vlah"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01", "start": 0, "end": 53, "text": "Моравица or Моравица ) is a river in western Serbia ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01", "start": 54, "end": 223, "text": "With a length of 98 km , [ 1 ] it is the longer headstream of the West Morava ( the name it takes at its confluence with the Đetinja ) , and thus , of the Great Morava ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01", "start": 224, "end": 382, "text": "Its name , Moravica , means `` little Morava '' in Serbian , and it also gives its name to the surrounding region and the modern Moravica District of Serbia ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01", "start": 383, "end": 486, "text": "Stari Vlah [ edit ] The Golijska Moravica originates from the western slopes of the Golija mountain and"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02", "start": 0, "end": 114, "text": "Викимедијиној остави Голијска Моравица је река у Србији у западном делу земље у региону Старог Влаха и Поморавља ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02", "start": 115, "end": 236, "text": "Извире на падинама планине Голије и тече према северу кроз град Ивањицу све до ушћа у Западну Мораву недалеко од Пожеге ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02", "start": 237, "end": 252, "text": "Дуга је 98 km ."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02", "start": 253, "end": 357, "text": "[ 1 ] Ток [ уреди | уреди извор ] Извор реке је на северним обронцима Голије на висини од 1.350 метара ."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02", "start": 358, "end": 386, "text": "У близини засеока Саковићи ."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02", "start": 387, "end": 478, "text": "[ 2 ] Настаје спајањем Голијске реке и Вучачке реке у селу Глеђица код засеока Лепосавићи ."}, "D3S7": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02", "start": 479, "end": 530, "text": "Код места званог Међуречје у Моравицу се улива река"}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00:c0", "entity": "Golijska Moravica", "scope": "river length", "claim": "The Golijska Moravica has a length of 98 km.", "answer": "98 km", "quote": "With a length of 98 km, it is the longer headstream of the Zapadna Morava (it forms it with the Đetinja), and thus, of the Velika Morava.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01:c0", "entity": "Moravica river", "scope": "length", "claim": "The Moravica river has a length of 98